  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2096,
      "text": "When hardship strikes you at sea, you forget all those whom you invoke besides Him[62]. Then when He brings you safe to the land, you turn away. Mankind is ever ungrateful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 289,
      "ruku": 246,
      "hizbQuarter": 115,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2097,
      "text": "Do you feel secure that He will not make some part of the land swallow you up, or send against you a storm of stones? Thereupon you will find none to protect you.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 68,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 289,
      "ruku": 246,
      "hizbQuarter": 115,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2098,
      "text": "Or do you feel secure that He will not send you back [to sea] once again, and send upon you a violent storm to drown you on account of your disbelief? Thereupon you will find none to help you against Us[63].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 69,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 289,
      "ruku": 246,
      "hizbQuarter": 115,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2099,
      "text": "We have honored the children of Adam, carried them on land and sea, provided for them good things[64] and favored them above many of those whom We have created.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 70,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 289,
      "ruku": 246,
      "hizbQuarter": 116,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2100,
      "text": "On the Day when We will summon every community with its leader[65]. Those who are given their record in their right hand will read their record [happily]; they will not be wronged even as much as the thread of a date stone.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 71,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 289,
      "ruku": 247,
      "hizbQuarter": 116,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2101,
      "text": "But whoever was blind [from the truth][66] in this life will be even blinder in the Hereafter and further astray from the right way.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 72,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 289,
      "ruku": 247,
      "hizbQuarter": 116,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2102,
      "text": "They were about to tempt you away from what We have revealed to you [O Prophet] so that you would fabricate something else and attribute it to Us; then they would have surely taken you as a close friend.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 73,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 289,
      "ruku": 247,
      "hizbQuarter": 116,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2103,
      "text": "Had We not made you stand firm, you would nearly have inclined to them a little.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 74,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 289,
      "ruku": 247,
      "hizbQuarter": 116,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2104,
      "text": "In that case, We would have made you taste double punishment, both in this life and after death. Thereupon you would have found no helper against Us.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
